Package: mintsweep
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Sam <sam@local>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Recommends: policykit-1 | pkexec
Description: System and Cache Cleaner for Linux Mint
 MintSweep is a native GTK3 desktop utility designed for Linux Mint to scan
 and clean APT package caches, thumbnail stores, old system journals,
 and user trash to reclaim disk space safely.
